@startuml Market_Intelligence_DataFlow
!theme cerulean-outline
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam activityDiamondFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11

title Market Intelligence - Data Flow Diagram

|#E8F5E9|External Sources|
|#FFF3E0|Ingestion Pipeline|
|#E3F2FD|Processing|
|#F3E5F5|Storage|
|#FFEBEE|Analytics|
|#E8F4FD|Presentation|

|External Sources|
start
fork
:📰 FNSPID Dataset\n(Hugging Face);
fork again
:📡 Finnhub API\n(Real-time News);
fork again
:📈 yfinance\n(Stock Prices);
end fork

|Ingestion Pipeline|
:Batch/Stream Loader;
note right
  - FNSPIDLoader: Historical data
  - NewsLoader: Live news
  - MarketFetcher: Price data
end note

|Processing|
fork
:Generate Embeddings\n(Sentence Transformer);
note right: 384-dim vectors
fork again
:Calculate Returns\n(yfinance historical);
note right: Day 1/7/30 %
fork again
:Extract Topics\n(Rule-based NLP);
note right: Earnings, M&A, etc.
fork again
:Sentiment Analysis\n(TextBlob);
note right: -1.0 to +1.0
end fork

|Storage|
:FalkorDB\nKnowledge Graph;
note right
  Nodes:
  - Company (ticker)
  - News (headline, embedding, returns)
  - Topic (category)
  
  Relationships:
  - [:MENTIONS]
  - [:HAS_TOPIC]
end note

|Analytics|
split
:Vector Similarity\nSearch;
note right: Find similar past events
split again
:Pattern Matching\n(Alert System);
split again
:Backtesting\n(Accuracy Validation);
end split

:Prediction Engine;
note right
  Inputs:
  - Top K similar events
  - Historical returns
  - AI sentiment
  
  Outputs:
  - Predicted returns
  - Confidence score
  - Evidence list
end note

|Presentation|
fork
:📊 Return Trajectory\n(30-day projection);
fork again
:📈 Price Charts\n(Interactive);
fork again
:🔔 Alert Notifications\n(Email/Slack);
fork again
:📋 Evidence Table\n(Historical proof);
fork again
:🤖 AI Report\n(LLM Summary);
end fork

:Streamlit Dashboard;
stop

@enduml
